  "worksAsStation": true,
  "description": "Teams of equal size line up outside the blue line, each with pucks and its own net, and race each other. The first skater goes in alone and shoots until they score, then skates back out past the blue line and goes again with the next skater, 2-on-0 (two attackers, no defenders). Then it's 3-on-0, and so on, adding one skater each time. Everyone in the group touches the puck before a shot; when the last skater scores, the whole team dives across the blue line to finish.",
