    "Skater 1 goes in alone and shoots until they score.",
    "Score? Skate back out past the blue line.",
    "Go again 2-on-0 with the next skater; both touch the puck before a shot.",
    "Keep adding one skater: 3-on-0, then 4-on-0.",
    "Last skater scores? Everyone dives across the blue line."
  ],
